== CR-35-M-1's measurement: the last observed cycle, from the probe ==
$ one $display of misc.cycle at the misc monitor report phase, then the run
   MCPROBE last_observed_cycle=21480
   last retirement cycle: 21478
   ecc injections judged=906 qualified=894 missing=0 unobservable=1
$ python3 -c "the two conditions on an injection cycle c"
   last observed cycle 21480, last retirement 21478, window 2, so the TAIL is 2
   the case needs c > 21478 and c + 2 <= 21480, i.e. c <= 21478
   21478 is not greater than 21478, so no c exists: EMPTY, and by exactly one cycle

